{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：16:27 2026-09-13 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日沙田賽事爆冷頻頻，第六場東華三院挑戰盃亦爆冷收場，伍鵬志馬房的「金駒永騰」在騎師黃智弘胯下起步即貼欄領放，入直路即越走越勁，就此直奔終點，爆岀三十二倍大冷獨贏，練馬師伍鵬志則連贏三個賽馬日。</p>\n<p>今季跑了三次賽事，伍鵬志馬房期期賽事都有馬贏，手風大順。今日第六場四班千六米東華三院挑戰盃，由伍鵬志訓練的「金駒永騰」於黃智弘胯下取勝捧盃而回，替伍廄延續贏馬旺勢。賽後一眾馬主及其朋友在凱旋門拉完頭馬後，各人手執投注「金駒永騰」WP的彩票，部分彩票顯示投注一千元WP，而該駒為獨贏三十二倍大冷門，有獎金收兼投注中馬，可見幕後收穫豐富呢！</p>\n<p>伍鵬志說：「『金駒永騰』來自巴西，來投我馬房時健康理想，我嘗試過安排馬兒跑不同的路程，暫時來看以千四米至千六米較合。『金駒永騰』是肉身馬，應會越跑越好，原本想跑今日五班田草千四米，但因為被列為後備，所以轉跑今場四班田草千六米賽。」</p>\n<h2>按下圖睇更多相片：</h2>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d0135182a97edbb850eb5eeec083f715/2026-09/0acf8ebd-456e-4e9c-ab2c-7dc847dc2011.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/22cf1fa3e846aeab6f89fb95f07dbf59/2026-09/6e6d3cf2-d0ae-4d14-8c0c-3903bd7ea00e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4b3aca0972ccfa3c595ad64541e2db46/2026-09/6fa6a2b4-2019-4238-b5b0-93923bf74607.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/87b52e746156cf0293f167e507157d65/2026-09/73b6eb9f-4039-4130-8274-e5569b838597.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/12efde94dd48a1a5153b401fab8d34bf/2026-09/81e46969-9fbc-4f8c-8bec-1e5c6d6e20ce.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/2e78ee56aab3a2106a3fe59be83bc288/2026-09/91e4b646-f979-4553-a635-f7267210a06e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/33bab4c3dd80e989ccc4a60a41250c7d/2026-09/915d9a60-060a-4dac-bc5d-fb7248ef3766.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d291c020e51750291cc8b3afe056e08b/2026-09/6370fba6-856d-454b-98d2-0e5cefd7f42d.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/0a3d56bec205fdb77f8e97f71ec24429/2026-09/83536fc6-16ff-4904-95b3-c64e286b9c6c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/457997ca8d077e4fb7728dd68d114a30/2026-09/a6adfadd-1b88-45fe-a06f-1523e91bb874.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/79010bc936f67bbd3c1cc18dcabc5578/2026-09/b566ce68-4d62-4496-9014-0c661d45184c.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/09665ab5031579fc8270318f0a4884a9/2026-09/c67f2f81-a631-4406-b38b-260d3b648a7e.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6d173d2aba36053ef08c00ea38db6e1c/2026-09/d7b68c00-30a2-49cd-ab7b-d3b3e3f96ce3.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/139381735995ce866420954aea6347f4/2026-09/dd9834b8-2678-4dab-a56d-af08add34eb0.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/df914bd17bf14bb0eb0d615a8f3535a9/2026-09/de4605db-3be5-4041-9359-8728e83acef1.jpg\"/>\n<img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/81218cfeca7ade89815786c00885e978/2026-09/f581700e-60b9-489c-854e-5cf3bab68c7f.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-13T08:38:17.544030+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":418,"images":16,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}